#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:1
msgid "PivotValueField"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:1
msgid ""
"A field in the *Values* area of a pivot table, accessed via {class}"
"`PivotValueFields <xlwings.PivotValueFields>`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:1
msgid ""
"Returns the native object (`pywin32` or `appscript` obj) of the engine being "
"used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:1
msgid ""
"`\"sum\"`, `\"count\"`, `\"average\"`, `\"max\"`, `\"min\"`, `\"product\"`, "
"`\"count_numbers\"`, `\"stdev\"`, `\"stdevp\"`, `\"var\"` or `\"varp\"`. "
"Returns `None` if the engine only knows that Excel picked the default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../xlwings/main.py:docstring of xlwings.PivotValueField.function:0
msgid "type"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../xlwings/main.py:docstring of xlwings.PivotValueField.function:9
msgid "Returns or sets the summary function"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:0
msgid "Setter type"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:1
msgid ""
"Returns or sets the caption, e.g. `\"Sum of Sales\"`. Excel rejects a name "
"that equals the name of a source field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:4
msgid ""
"On xlwings Lite and xlwings Server, reading it only works for value fields "
"that already existed when the script started or if the name was set in the "
"same script. The automatic caption of a value field added in the same script "
"can't be read."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:1
msgid "Returns or sets the number format of the value field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:3
msgid ""
"On xlwings Lite and xlwings Server, reading it only works for value fields "
"that already existed when the script started or if the format was set in the "
"same script."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:1
msgid "Returns the pivot table the field belongs to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:1
msgid "Removes the field from the values area."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/pivot_value_field.md:1
msgid "The name of the source field this value field summarizes."
msgstr ""
